Package: ascii-animals-screensaver
Version: @VERSION@
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3 (>= 3.9), python3-gi, gir1.2-glib-2.0, gir1.2-gtk-3.0, gir1.2-webkit2-4.1
Recommends: gnome-shell
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Maintainer: @MAINTAINER@
Homepage: https://github.com/Elthrai377/ascii-animals-screensaver
Description: screensaver with pixel and ASCII animals behind a big clock
 Butterflies, koi, jellyfish, dragonflies, frogs, cranes and crabs drift
 across the screen, drawn as tinted pixels and ASCII glyphs, behind a large
 clock and the date.
 .
 A small idle watcher starts it after a few minutes without input (GNOME,
 Wayland or X11). Any key, click or mouse movement closes it.
